    "title": "Help",
    "subtitle": "Frequently asked questions",
    "contactSupport": "Contact support",
    "faq1q": "How do I log a practice?",
    "faq1a": "Go to the Home tab and find your practice card. Each card shows the input for that day. Changes save automatically.",
    "faq2q": "What is a Yatra?",
    "faq2a": "A Yatra is a group practice circle. Members track practices together and hold each other accountable.",
    "faq3q": "How do I share a chart?",
    "faq3a": "Go to Charts and tap the Share button in the page header. A public link is copied to your clipboard.",
    "faq4q": "Can I use the app offline?",
    "faq4a": "Yes. The app loads cached data when offline. Changes queue automatically and sync when connectivity returns.",
    "faq5q": "How do I import data?",
    "faq5a": "Go to Settings → Import data. Upload a CSV file, map the columns to your practices, then confirm.",
    "faq6q": "How do I change my language?",
    "faq6a": "Go to Settings → Language and select English, Русский, or Українська.",
    "faq7q": "How do I add a new practice?",
    "faq7a": "Go to Settings → My practices and tap the + button, or tap the + FAB on the Home tab.",
    "faq8q": "How do I reorder my practices?",
    "faq8a": "Go to Settings → My practices and drag the handle on the left of each row."
